fix(no schedule): coordinate via WhatsApp instead of a dead "Solicitar servicio"

When a public pro has no upcoming slots, "Solicitar servicio" would open an empty
calendar. Now:
- /buscar card: a public pro with no slots shows "Este profesional coordina por
  WhatsApp." + the WhatsApp (+ Llamar) buttons, bottom-pinned — no Solicitar /
  ver-horario. (new schedule.coordinateWhatsApp key, ES/EN.) Replaces the old
  "Sin horarios próximos. Solicita el servicio para coordinar."
- Booking modal: the public "no availability configured" state now shows a clear
  "Coordinar por WhatsApp" button (matching the private state), so the profile's
  Solicitar path never lands on an empty/broken calendar either.

